      "id": "github:148059143",
      "name": "AKHQ",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "面向 Apache Kafka 的开源管理 GUI，用于查看 topics 与 topic 内消息数据、查看 consumer groups 及其 offsets，创建/修改/删除 topics、清空 topic、更新或删除 consumer group offsets，并接入 Schema Registry 与 Kafka Connect。",
      "homepage": "https://akhq.io/",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/tchiotludo/akhq",
      "github_repository_id": 148059143,
      "license": "Apache-2.0",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/tchiotludo/akhq/master/LICENSE",
      "features": [
        "查看 topics 并浏览 topic 内消息数据（分页与排序）",
        "topic 列表展示 consumer groups 列，consumer groups 视图可隐藏空组",
        "创建/修改/删除 topics、清空 topic，生产或删除记录",
        "更新/删除 consumer group offsets、删除 consumer group",
        "基于 TOPIC/TOPIC_DATA/CONSUMER_GROUP/ACL 等资源与角色的权限模型",
        "查看/管理 Schema Registry 与 Kafka Connect 状态"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Docker/docker compose 快速启动",
        "支持 Helm 部署（文档导航）"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Apache Kafka",
        "Schema Registry",
        "Kafka Connect"
      ],
